			"Message": "style(Common): Format core modules and tests with consistent whitespace\n\nApply formatting adjustments across Container, EffectSmol, Errors, PubSub, Ref, Result, and tsconfig.json:\n\n- Insert blank lines between methods and blocks for improved readability\n- Reformat array and tuple types in Container and test files for clarity\n- Align type parameters and object literals for consistency\n- Apply uniform formatting to tsconfig.json include/lib arrays\n\nPurely stylistic changes to enhance code clarity and maintainability in the Common crate's core modules.",
